A mapping tool is f\*cking amazing. I can't believe it started as a hobby.

&amp;#x200B;

As for logistics and stuff? Depends on where in the world you're going. I have a list of like 25 backpacking and hiking sites that I get a newsfeed off of and don't pull inspiration from any one single place. For example, my suggestion for a national forest in California is going to be WAY different than, say, a national park in Northern California.
